OL,3,CWoman accused of attempting to murder
OL,4,Cchild to face new trial next year
OL,6,FA woman from Birmingham accused of
OL,7,Fattempting to murder a child by
OL,8,Ftampering with his medication is
OL,9,Fexpected to face a new trial next year.
OL,11,FJurors failed to reach a verdict in
OL,12,Fthe first trial of Emma Jane Williams,
OL,13,F41, at Birmingham Crown Court last
OL,14,Fmonth after more than six hours of
OL,15,Fdeliberations.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
