OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786096135
OL,3,CWoman accused of attempting to murder
OL,4,Cchild to face new trial next year
OL,6,FWilliams, of Erdington, denies a
OL,7,Fsingle count of attempted murder of
OL,8,Fthe boy, who cannot be identified due
OL,9,Fto a court order, which is alleged to
OL,10,Fhave been committed on the date of her
OL,11,Farrest.
OL,13,FAppearing at the crown court on
OL,14,FThursday (6 August), Williams, who
OL,15,Fappeared to wipe her eyes with a
OL,16,Ftissue in the dock, was told the Crown
OL,17,Fwould be seeking a retrial.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
