PN,34603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786096135
OL,3,CWoman accused of attempting to murder
OL,4,Cchild to face new trial next year
OL,6,FJudge Simon Drew KC told the defendant
OL,7,Fhe was "very sorry" that the first
OL,8,Fdate that was available for the new
OL,9,Ftrial, lasting seven to 10 days, was
OL,10,Fin March.
OL,12,FHe said he would make inquiries as to
OL,13,Fwhether a date in January could be
OL,14,Ffound.
OL,16,FThe defendant appeared tearful as she
OL,17,Fsaid: "Thank you, your honour."
